        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare congenital X-linked dyserythropoietic anemia characterized by moderate to severe anemia without thrombocytopenia variable degrees of neutropenia and bone marrow findings of trilineage dysplasia with hypocellularity of erythroid and granulocytic lineages. Peripheral blood shows anisocytosis macrocytosis poikilocytosis elliptocytes and fragmented erythrocytes. Platelet count is typically normal although platelet morphology may be abnormal."
        },
